        <mxCell id="data_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Target data controls&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• tenant key on every row with database constraints&lt;br&gt;• bounded raw-content retention and scheduled deletion&lt;br&gt;• encrypted storage, logs, backups, snapshots, and replicas&lt;br&gt;• tested point-in-time restore and deletion from backups&lt;br&gt;• administrator access logged and separated from application roles" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3F8624;fontColor=#545B64;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="data_plane">
