        <mxCell id="reference_note" value="PROPOSED REFERENCE — version 0.1 provisions none of these AWS resources and includes no infrastructure-as-code. Production adaptation requires authenticated tenant isolation, reviewed authorization, data classification, migrations, backup/restore testing, accessibility review, threat-led security testing, and domain-specific privacy and legal approval." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#7A5C00;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
